<section class="menu-about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What's on the Lalasea Bistro menu?</h2>
    <p>Lalasea Bistro is an open-air restaurant on To Chau beach in Ha Tien (An Giang province, Vietnam), open from 08:00 to 23:00 every day, and from 07:00 on Saturdays and Sundays. As well as live seafood, the menu has grilled dishes, hotpot, beef, chicken and rice, so it works well for big groups with different tastes. Below are the main sections of the menu — swipe through the menu photos above to see every dish with its price.</p>

    <h3>Lalasea's signature dishes</h3>
    <p>The four dishes Lalasea is known for: spicy pork ribs, crab in curry sauce, a mixed seafood bucket piled with shrimp, squid, clams and crab, and herring salad made the Ha Tien coastal way.</p>

    <ul class="mon-noi-bat">
      <li>
        <img src="/anh/suon-cay-thai-lan-lalasea-ha-tien.jpg" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"
             alt="Spicy Thai-style pork ribs at Lalasea Bistro Ha Tien — tender ribs piled high, topped with herbs and fresh chilli, served in a hot pan">
        <div class="nd">
          <span class="ten">Spicy Pork Ribs <span lang="vi">(Sườn cay)</span></span>
          <span class="gia">289,000 / 389,000 / 489,000 VND by size</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/anh/hai-san-xo-lalasea-ha-tien.jpg" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"
             alt="Mixed seafood bucket at Lalasea Bistro Ha Tien — crab, shrimp, clams, sausage and corn in curry sauce, poured from the bucket onto a steel tray">
        <div class="nd">
          <span class="ten">Mixed Seafood Bucket <span lang="vi">(Hải sản xô)</span></span>
          <span class="gia">289,000 / 389,000 / 489,000 VND by size</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <img src="/anh/goi-ca-trich-lalasea-ha-tien.jpg" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"
             alt="Ha Tien herring salad at Lalasea Bistro — herring fillets arranged like a flower around fresh chilli, with rice paper and fresh herbs">
        <div class="nd">
          <span class="ten">Herring Salad <span lang="vi">(Gỏi cá trích)</span></span>
          <span class="gia">189,000 VND</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>The fourth — <strong>crab in curry sauce</strong> — is sold at the day's market price because it depends on the fresh crab bought that morning; order ahead so the restaurant can quote a price and save you a portion.</p>

    <h3>Snails, cockles &amp; clams</h3>
    <p>Babylon snail, bulot snail, razor clam, black apple snail, blood cockle, cockle, giant clam, clam, abalone… cooked every way: wok-fried with garlic, roasted with rock salt, grilled with scallion oil, grilled with cheese, salted egg yolk sauce, spicy butter sauce, Thai style steamed, steamed with lemongrass.</p>

    <h3>Live seafood</h3>
    <p>Shrimp, crab, blue crab, squid and seasonal fish are kept live every day — pick your seafood and how you'd like it cooked.</p>

    <h3>Small plates to share</h3>
    <p>Grilled scallops with chili salt, crispy fried frog, Hong Kong-style salt &amp; pepper frog, smoked goose breast, diced beef steak, Vietnamese sizzling beef, sweet and sour pork ribs, Hong Kong-style salt &amp; pepper chicken cartilage, fish sauce-glazed chicken wings…</p>

    <h3>Ha Tien dried specialties</h3>
    <p>Lemongrass marinated dried shrimp, mango salad with dried snakehead fish, fish sauce-glazed dried squid with crispy taro strings, sun-dried squid, sun-dried sand whiting with tamarind sauce — great for snacking at the table, and to take home as gifts.</p>

    <h3>Hotpot &amp; grill</h3>
    <p>Thai hotpot, Tomyum hotpot, fermented fish hotpot, cobia fish hotpot, field crab hotpot, mushroom hotpot and bitter melon &amp; beef ball hotpot, all at 289,000 VND. From the grill: grilled beef short plate, grilled thick-cut beef steak, grilled pork udder, and a BBQ combo with shrimp, octopus, beef, frog and sausage.</p>

    <h3>Pre-order party menu</h3>
    <p>Besides the everyday menu, Lalasea hosts weddings, birthdays and company parties with a separate party menu served by the portion: chicken, duck, rice, hotpot and other pre-ordered party dishes. See <a href="/en/events/">Events at Lalasea</a> for details.</p>

    <p>Menu prices may change over time; some seafood dishes are sold at the day's market price. To book a table or a party, call / message on Zalo <a href="tel:+84{{ thongtin.dien_thoai_goi | replace('0', '', 1) }}">{{ thongtin.dien_thoai | sdtQuocTe }}</a> or see <a href="/en/contact/">Contact &amp; directions</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const track = document.getElementById('track');
  const cur = document.getElementById('cur');
  const prev = document.getElementById('prev');
  const next = document.getElementById('next');
  const total = {{ menuanh.trang.length }};

  function page() { return Math.round(track.scrollLeft / track.clientWidth); }
  function update() {
    const p = page();
    cur.textContent = p + 1;
    prev.disabled = p <= 0;
    next.disabled = p >= total - 1;
  }
  function go(dir) { track.scrollTo({ left: (page() + dir) * track.clientWidth, behavior: 'smooth' }); }

  prev.addEventListener('click', () => go(-1));
  next.addEventListener('click', () => go(1));
  track.addEventListener('scroll', () => window.requestAnimationFrame(update));
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') go(-1);
    if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') go(1);
  });
  update();
</script>

